Z||000007||Black86SE||11-18-2001||10:56 PM||||Hey, thanks guys. That is what I though it was but I was told that they were smaller holes. Cool. More horsepower, here I come.||||reg||1
Z||000008||Fleabitdog||11-19-2001||07:25 AM||||It is not hard to do at all. I have two sets I just did and am working with a friend on making new manifolds that are bigger and made out of stainless steel including the flanges. I will post pics when they are done. Dave||||reg||1
Z||000009||Phil||11-19-2001||07:50 AM||||The stock manifolds and flanges are stainless.||||reg||1
